            "review_text": "stempster\nPotomac, Maryland255 contributions\n1\nGreat introduction to Vietnamese crepes (Banh Khot)\nJan 2019 • Couples\nThis was the 3rd stop on our evening Vespa tour of HCM City. The specialty of the house is Banh Khot, a/k/a savory Vietnamese rice pancakes/crepes. It was a great introduction for us We sat outside and the place was lively. The food was very tasty. Appeared to be mostly locals. I'm not sure we would have found it on our own, but worth the effort to get there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 19, 2019",
