            "review_text": "Valeriepoupounette\nVung Tau, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nAmazing culinary experience\nDec 2018 • Family\nWe went to this restaurant on advice of our hotel. We loved it so much. It’s not a place for tourists as it is full of locals. You must have the small rice crepes and the large one folded in half. There is a drink with jelly and seeds that was very good too. The staff are super busy. The kitchen is opened and you can see everything.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 30, 2018",
