            "review_title": "Review at Banh Khot Co Ba Vung Tau",
            "review_text": "Jason P\nSunnyvale, California49 contributions\n0\nBahn Xeo 46A was closed...but I still got to experience Banh Xeo\nOct 2018\nSo, I am a big fan of Anthony Bourdain(RIP).\nI had been paying tribute by going to places that he had visited during his TV years.\nYes, I know this Banh Xeo 46A has become a tourist spot and food is just ok.\nBut I still went there and darn! It was closed.\nFast forward few days and I had to leave so I opted for Banh Khot Co Ba Vung Tau.\nUnlike the BX46A which is street food stall, this place is a restaurant.\nI am having BX for the first time so how can I compare.\nLiked the crispy omelet(albeit a little greasy) and fresh veggies that were served to wrap the BX.\nOverall, I liked BX and would definitely try again.\nThis places is clean and quiet unlike many other places. \nWould recommend visiting.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 19, 2018",
