            "review_text": "Kathy Ngo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam21 contributions\n1\nA traditional Vietnamese cuisine restaurant\nApr 2018 • Family\nThe restaurant chain has been well-known for the locals. Although it offers a wide range of traditional food such as Bun and Goi, etc. It's specialized in making Banh Khot and Banh Xeo. I personally think they are just normal, not too yummy as expected. \nThese Banh are served with some green vegetables, which according to the restaurant, they are all very hygiene. \nThe price is from 60k to 200k/ dish( i find it quite expensive)\nA pretty big and warm atmosphere. \nThe restaurant is not my favorite but I would recommend it to any tourists or family dine out.\nRead more\nWritten April 16, 2018",
